Title :  Vancouver East-Boundary Rd-House-Ground fl-2 renovated suites-$1,700

Vancouver East - Boundary area - Two newly renovated detached houses- ground floor suites , each unit approximately 700 sq ft, rent $1,700 each.

Located on the border of East Vancouver and Burnaby, next to Adanac Park . 
these two newly renovated suites , each with its own entrance, both are 2-bedroom, 1-kitchen, and 1-bathroom on ground floor.

One suite has a separate front entrance and shares a washer/dryer with the upstairs tenant; 

Another suite  has a separate back entrance and its own brand-new washer/dryer. 

Each bedroom has a wardrobe, and each bathroom has a bathtub. 

Convenient transportation; a bus stop is right outside, and it's a 5-minute drive to Highway 1. Close to Hastings St., with restaurants, banks, and supermarkets nearby.  Suitable for non-smoking, no-pet, no-marijuana, 1-3 people per Suite . Rent includes water and internet; unfurnished.    Electricity and gas are not included; each unit pays 25% of the bill.

Parking: Street parking;

Amenities: Washer, Dryer, Microwave, Refrigerator;

Rent includes: Water, Internet;

Rent excludes: Furniture, Electricity, and Gas;

Separate entrance: Yes;
Availability: June 1, 2026;
Rent or price: $1,700
